  "bio": "Flavia Verda is a proficient tattoo artist, specializing in the illustrative style, based in Bucharest, Romania. With a high level of skill and detail reflected in her work, she not only creates unique tattoos but also has a flare for designing vibrant stickers for Sticky Friendz. Regarded for her professionalism, Flavia maintains a high standard of cleanliness in her studio, ensuring a comfortable environment for all her clients.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Bucharest, Romania"
